### IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client: har bir so'rovni "Run" tugmasi bilan ishga tushiring.
### Swagger UI hujjati: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
### OpenAPI JSON: http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs

### 1) Admin sifatida kirish (token avtomatik saqlanadi)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@stroy.local", "password": "Admin12345!" }

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token); %}

### 2) Ro'yxatdan o'tish (mijoz)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ali Valiyev",
  "email": "ali@example.com",
  "phone": "+998901234567",
  "companyName": "Ali Qurilish",
  "password": "Parol12345"
}

> {% client.global.set("userToken", response.body.token); %}

### 3) Kategoriyalar
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories

### 4) Mahsulotlar (filtr + sahifalash)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?q=цемент&sort=price_asc&page=0&size=12

### 5) Buyurtma berish (mijoz tokeni bilan)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ali Valiyev",
  "phone": "+998901234567",
  "address": "Toshkent, Chilonzor 5",
  "comment": "Ertalab yetkazing",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 20 },
    { "productId": 4, "quantity": 500 }
  ]
}

### 6) Mening buyurtmalarim
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 7) Admin: yangi mahsulot
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Плитка керамическая 30x30",
  "sku": "TILE-3030",
  "description": "Напольная плитка",
  "price": 85000,
  "unit": "м²",
  "minOrderQuantity": 10,
  "stock": 1500,
  "imageUrl": null,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "active": true
}

### 8) Admin: buyurtmalar ro'yxati
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/orders?status=NEW
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9) Admin: buyurtma holatini o'zgartirish
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONFIRMED" }

### 10) Admin: statistika
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11) Aloqa formasi (ochiq)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Vali", "phone": "+998901112233", "message": "Narx haqida so'rayman" }
